জাইছা;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"তুমি মোৰ মূৰ তেলেৰে তিয়াইছা;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"মোৰ পান-পাত্ৰ উপচি পৰিছে","poem":1},{"noteId":23},{"text":"।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"অৱশ্যে মঙ্গল আৰু দয়া আয়ুসৰ সকলো কালত মোৰ পাছত যাওঁতা হ’ব,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"আৰু মই চিৰকাললৈকে যিহোৱাৰ গৃহত বাস কৰিবলৈ পাম।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"লুক 7:46: ই হ’ল আলহীক আদৰি লোৱাৰ এক চিন।","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}